DPQ Fortran port licensing
==========================

The combined dpq-fortran distribution is GPL-3.0-or-later because it includes
a component derived from the GPL-3 Algorithm 1006 implementation in upstream
DPQ (`src/gamma_inc_T1006.c`).

Source-file licensing remains explicit:

* DPQ-derived code other than the TOMS 1006 component: GPL-2.0-or-later.
* `src/dpq_toms1006.f90`: GPL-3.0-or-later.
* `src/r_mod.F90`: MIT, as supplied by the user.

Full license texts are in LICENSES/. Upstream licensing and copyright details
are retained verbatim under upstream/LICENSE and upstream/COPYRIGHTS.
